# New Mexico Desert


NEW MEXICO DESERT

open book
take slip
examine slip
examine diagram

# The diagram legend is randomized and looks like this:
# RD=DET BL=GND ST=INF WH=POS
# The two-letter codes are wire colors (RD means RED; BL means
# BLUE; ST means STRIPED; WH means WHITE), and the three-letter
# codes are wire functions (DET means DETONATOR; GND means GROUND;
# INF means INFORMER; POS means POSITIVE). This set is set as:
# RD=DET BL=GND ST=POS WH=INF

drop slip
w. d. d
take ruby
put ruby in red boot
nw. nw. nw
open jeep
in
examine radio
examine dial

